※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4562
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4562 LANG_BORROW_SAYS_NOTHING

※ A lambda answering with a reference says how long it lives, as a function
※ does: nothing written is no default, the two answers meaning different things
※ to whoever calls it.

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup, impure]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    let x: u32 = 1u32
    let same := λ a: &u32 → &u32 { a }
    if same(&x)⌖ = 1u32: 0u6 else: 1u6
